    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rooster Rampage</strong></h2>Rooster Rampage is a chicken based zombie shooter about an all-out war to save human-kind!!!<br>Engage your inner chicken in the single player campaign to fend off hordes of zombies across amazing chicken inspired worlds, or locate a nearby Rampage in action!!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/ce80398135cba475a1fe403c72c8e7f4.poster.avif?t=1627918481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/ce80398135cba475a1fe403c72c8e7f4.webm?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/ce80398135cba475a1fe403c72c8e7f4.mp4?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Zombies Hordes appear</strong></h2>Experience the ultimate combination of chicken and physics in Rooster Rampage the next leap in chicken based combat.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/53e73d922e07259fc6730fc3cea7884f.poster.avif?t=1627918481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/53e73d922e07259fc6730fc3cea7884f.webm?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/53e73d922e07259fc6730fc3cea7884f.mp4?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Armed to the Beak</strong></h2>Armed with chicken based firepower and the grit to erase all zombies<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/67a27b08fb1a299d645a09fbc3d33fff.poster.avif?t=1627918481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/67a27b08fb1a299d645a09fbc3d33fff.webm?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/67a27b08fb1a299d645a09fbc3d33fff.mp4?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Destructive Environments</strong></h2>Terrain, and building destruction are available to all chickens who rampage within.   <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/5809e755ec4acd8a6a2ac5c6f163b0d0.poster.avif?t=1627918481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/5809e755ec4acd8a6a2ac5c6f163b0d0.webm?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/5809e755ec4acd8a6a2ac5c6f163b0d0.mp4?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/c07b8725e9f2b2d9e4e239d3387d2e23.poster.avif?t=1627918481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/c07b8725e9f2b2d9e4e239d3387d2e23.webm?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/c07b8725e9f2b2d9e4e239d3387d2e23.mp4?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CO-OP Rooster Rampages</strong></h2>Experience chicken infused co-op adventures that will transcend your previous chicken based co-op experiences.<br><div clas